{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Where are you, Cinderella?</i></strong><i> is a visual novel about Vietnamese culture and the world of entertainment, with a fresh and modern twist on the Cinderella story.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/dd14ccb75c87549e535f3e0292185332.avif?t=1755116106\" width=620 height=70 /></span>Play as Tam, an actress looking for her Prince Charming, or Alberto, a famous singer searching for his Cinderella! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/5f3fd3d258982806564008ade9f21334.poster.avif?t=1755116106\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/5f3fd3d258982806564008ade9f21334.webm?t=1755116106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/5f3fd3d258982806564008ade9f21334.mp4?t=1755116106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/0a2e025a43e5ba524f503ba6c3483875.avif?t=1755116106\" width=620 height=70 /></span>You will have the pleasure of meeting and chatting with many curious characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/ff1ef65efaf01c8c691a3fa23a0c3ab3.avif?t=1755116106\" width=616 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/2f8a9a4f9b47454261a4faa1933b2b2c.avif?t=1755116106\" width=620 height=70 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The routes are interconnected: the choices made in one protagonist's route influence the other one. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > References and explanations relating to Vietnamese culture, as well as small cultural references to other Asian countries (China, South Korea, Japan...) and the world of entertainment, will also be included! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A sweet and colourful universe awaits you.  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2416930?t=1755116106","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2416930?t=1755116106","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/f6400a6b9e1d857a6b51e142bb8ae1679bc130f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755116106","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/f6400a6b9e1d857a6b51e142bb8ae1679bc130f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755116106","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Where are you, Cinderella?</i></strong><i> is a visual novel about Vietnamese culture and the world of entertainment, with a fresh and modern twist on the Cinderella story.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/